<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>Help Center - Blue Wave</title>

    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
</head>

<body>

    <!-- Navigation bar -->
    <%- include('./partials/navbar.ejs') %>


    <!-- Help Center -->
    <main class="help-page">

        <!-- Page heading -->
        <section class="help-header">

            <h1>
                Help Center
            </h1>

            <p>
                Find answers to common questions about lessons,
                bookings, and staying safe in the water.
            </p>

        </section>


        <!-- Frequently Asked Questions -->
        <section class="faq-section">

            <details class="faq-item">

                <summary>
                    What surfing level should I choose?
                </summary>

                <p>
                    Beginners are welcome to start with a Beginner lesson.
                    Intermediate and Advanced lessons are available for
                    surfers with previous experience.
                </p>

            </details>


            <details class="faq-item">

                <summary>
                    Do I need previous surfing experience?
                </summary>

                <p>
                    No. Our Beginner lessons are designed for people
                    who are learning to surf for the first time.
                </p>

            </details>


            <details class="faq-item">

                <summary>
                    What is the Water Awareness Class?
                </summary>

                <p>
                    The Water Awareness Class is an optional add-on that
                    covers waves, currents, water conditions, basic safety,
                    and emergency awareness.
                </p>

            </details>


            <details class="faq-item">

                <summary>
                    Can I change my booking?
                </summary>

                <p>
                    Yes. After logging in, you can view your bookings
                    and edit your lesson details.
                </p>

            </details>


            <details class="faq-item">

                <summary>
                    Can I cancel my booking?
                </summary>

                <p>
                    Yes. You can cancel your own booking from the
                    My Bookings page.
                </p>

            </details>


            <details class="faq-item">

                <summary>
                    Can families book together?
                </summary>

                <p>
                    Yes. Blue Wave offers Family Packages for
                    groups who want to enjoy a lesson together.
                </p>

            </details>

        </section>


        <!-- Still need help -->
        <section class="help-contact">

            <p class="hero-subtitle">
                STILL HAVE QUESTIONS?
            </p>

            <h2>
                We're here to help.
            </h2>

            <p>
                If you can't find what you're looking for,
                get in touch with the Blue Wave team.
            </p>

            <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary">
                Contact Us
            </a>

        </section>

    </main>

</body>

</html>